    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530">

                <pb facs="0691" n="571" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg571"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The King of Italy to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Genovareggia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">Telegram.—Translation.</p>
                <p>Delighted to have the visit of the beautiful vessel to which you have been
                    pleased to confide the mission of assisting at the fetes at Genoa. I desire to
                    thank you cordially for this friendly manifestation of good will.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Victor Emanuel.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
